{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 30, "width": 2239.1000000000004, "height": 907, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0000", "roundness": null, "seed": 125596179, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1534833630, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "hiLliCzny0ilbof9t9i4", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": -40, "width": 629.2, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 1162594106, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 998810334, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Prompt playground: versions, the 10 MB path, sharing", "fontSize": 22, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Prompt playground: versions, the 10 MB path, sharing", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "4Bm5rPeH4SJ2meAZEjXZ", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 20, "width": 515.9000000000001, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 1658794778, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 751416742, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Requirements (ask first)\n- browser product or API? single user or teams? one model?\n- what is a prompt: one message, or system + user + few-shot?\n- how big can a prompt be? keep outputs? sharing in scope, to whom?\nA user can: create \u00b7 edit \u00b7 RUN and see the output \u00b7 save versions,\nhistory, diffs \u00b7 rename / organise \u00b7 share by link \u00b7 delete.\nDeferred in one sentence: model + params picker, variables,\ntags, ratings, datasets / evals, batch runs, team roles.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Requirements (ask first)\n- browser product or API? single user or teams? one model?\n- what is a prompt: one message, or system + user + few-shot?\n- how big can a prompt be? keep outputs? sharing in scope, to whom?\nA user can: create \u00b7 edit \u00b7 RUN and see the output \u00b7 save versions,\nhistory, diffs \u00b7 rename / organise \u00b7 share by link \u00b7 delete.\nDeferred in one sentence: model + params picker, variables,\ntags, ratings, datasets / evals, batch runs, team roles.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "otKUH6nd7wQ3gYjEmXJj", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 188.0, "width": 592.9000000000001, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 1791937091, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1046316011, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Technical challenges\n- traffic is tiny: 1M users, 10k DAU, <1 RPS, 80/20 read/write -> no sharding\n- prompts 1 KB average, 10 MB max (~2.5M tokens, beyond any context)\n  -> the blob path IS the design\n- immutable versions make history, diffs, sharing, caching cheap\n- sharing needs scopes, roles, revocation; a shared prompt can go viral", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Technical challenges\n- traffic is tiny: 1M users, 10k DAU, <1 RPS, 80/20 read/write -> no sharding\n- prompts 1 KB average, 10 MB max (~2.5M tokens, beyond any context)\n  -> the blob path IS the design\n- immutable versions make history, diffs, sharing, caching cheap\n- sharing needs scopes, roles, revocation; a shared prompt can go viral", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "C5CocBQpi0G5OCPfzIMh", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 321.0, "width": 662.2, "height": 157.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 1272462563, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1920241157, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Core entities (with fields)\nPrompt(id, owner_id, name, latest_version_id, updated_at)\nPromptVersion(id, prompt_id, parent_version_id, body | body_ref, hash, size) immutable\nOutput(id, version_id, model, content_ref, tokens_in/out, latency_ms)\nShareLink(token, prompt_id, version_id?, scope public|link|account,\n          role viewer|editor, expires_at, revoked_at)\nAclEntry(prompt_id, principal_id, role)   op_log append-only\nIndexes: (owner_id, updated_at desc) (prompt_id, created_at desc) unique(token)\nNot entities: run (= Output row), thread (a name), model (a field)", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Core entities (with fields)\nPrompt(id, owner_id, name, latest_version_id, updated_at)\nPromptVersion(id, prompt_id, parent_version_id, body | body_ref, hash, size) immutable\nOutput(id, version_id, model, content_ref, tokens_in/out, latency_ms)\nShareLink(token, prompt_id, version_id?, scope public|link|account,\n          role viewer|editor, expires_at, revoked_at)\nAclEntry(prompt_id, principal_id, role)   op_log append-only\nIndexes: (owner_id, updated_at desc) (prompt_id, created_at desc) unique(token)\nNot entities: run (= Output row), thread (a name), model (a field)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "eVmX3BtF38SyyRuWvJGG", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 506.5, "width": 569.8000000000001, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 1431074361, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 403148841, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API\nPOST /prompts {name}   PATCH /prompts/{id} {name}   DELETE /prompts/{id}\nPOST /prompts/{id}/versions {parent_version_id, body | body_ref}\nGET /prompts/{id}/versions   GET /versions/{a}/diff/{b}\nPOST /versions/{id}/run -> SSE stream, then Output stored\nPOST /uploads {size, sha256} -> presigned multipart URL (object storage)\nPOST /prompts/{id}/share {scope, role, expires_in}   DELETE /share/{token}\nGET /s/{token} -> rendered view (CDN-cacheable when public)", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API\nPOST /prompts {name}   PATCH /prompts/{id} {name}   DELETE /prompts/{id}\nPOST /prompts/{id}/versions {parent_version_id, body | body_ref}\nGET /prompts/{id}/versions   GET /versions/{a}/diff/{b}\nPOST /versions/{id}/run -> SSE stream, then Output stored\nPOST /uploads {size, sha256} -> presigned multipart URL (object storage)\nPOST /prompts/{id}/share {scope, role, expires_in}   DELETE /share/{token}\nGET /s/{token} -> rendered view (CDN-cacheable when public)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "NyyC0TfpdsZMbUMDbbe2", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 674.5, "width": 585.2, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 1756504773, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 155844935, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What breaks first\n- 10 MB through the app server -> presigned upload, body_ref, range-GET\n- long diff chains -> checkpoint (full snapshot) every N versions\n- revoked link still served from cache -> revoked_at + short-TTL perm cache,\n  blob URLs signed separately (5-15 min)\n- two tabs editing one version -> branch or merge, never overwrite", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "What breaks first\n- 10 MB through the app server -> presigned upload, body_ref, range-GET\n- long diff chains -> checkpoint (full snapshot) every N versions\n- revoked link still served from cache -> revoked_at + short-TTL perm cache,\n  blob URLs signed separately (5-15 min)\n- two tabs editing one version -> branch or merge, never overwrite", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "dYDvymcW2vJ1b9hxdmjp", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a0007", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1939375111, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1736154831, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "NET6nwKmcZFxOrxjAtI2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "17vtp5jkcJlvkVKpDNmh"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "2wuL0V36I1TRBt8rpuGk"}], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "NET6nwKmcZFxOrxjAtI2", "type": "text", "x": 430, "y": 85.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a0008", "roundness": null, "seed": 944554268, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1373422500, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Browser\nvirtualised editor \u00b7 local draft cache\ndiff engine \u00b7 size gate + token count", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "dYDvymcW2vJ1b9hxdmjp", "originalText": "Browser\nvirtualised editor \u00b7 local draft cache\ndiff engine \u00b7 size gate + token count", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "K1k6j2ER8cthtpOZqzhf", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a0009", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 695655781, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 272194660, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "CTuZG3WlqxFADxHrgzUm"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "17vtp5jkcJlvkVKpDNmh"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "nPaCqRETr4d96TqgSlQE"}], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "CTuZG3WlqxFADxHrgzUm", "type": "text", "x": 950, "y": 85.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a0010", "roundness": null, "seed": 716506798, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1167898498, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CDN / edge\nstatic assets, public shared views\n(immutable versions cache well)", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "K1k6j2ER8cthtpOZqzhf", "originalText": "CDN / edge\nstatic assets, public shared views\n(immutable versions cache well)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "piTdsnj5W1yWATIo9Wx1", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1460, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a0011", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1083501295, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1643419518, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "3yWOdoDodbhm4yghHZhI"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "nPaCqRETr4d96TqgSlQE"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "l9lGKsFHOBQdV374h2BD"}], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "3yWOdoDodbhm4yghHZhI", "type": "text", "x": 1470, "y": 85.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a0012", "roundness": null, "seed": 161737053, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1446261554, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "lin