esumable transfer, range-GET.\nDiverging edits \u2192 versions have parents, so an edit of an old version is a branch; show branch-or-merge, never overwrite. Revoked link \u2192 revoked_at checked through a short-TTL cache; blob URLs signed for 5\u201315 min.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Failure / probes: 10 MB prompt through the app server (timeouts, 413, memory, Postgres TOAST, context window) \u2192 cap at the edge, presigned upload, body_ref, compression, chunked resumable transfer, range-GET.\nDiverging edits \u2192 versions have parents, so an edit of an old version is a branch; show branch-or-merge, never overwrite. Revoked link \u2192 revoked_at checked through a short-TTL cache; blob URLs signed for 5\u201315 min.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "JHYiqCtUKxGyBUdJ4grp", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 750, "width": 2048.2000000000003, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a0054", "roundness": null, "seed": 1093864046, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 654566394, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numbers to say: 1M users \u00b7 10k DAU \u00b7 under 1 RPS (do not shard) \u00b7 1 KB average, 10 MB max \u2248 2.5M tokens (beyond any context window) \u00b7 ~10 prompts per user \u2248 10 GB hot \u00b7 inline body under 64 KB, object storage above \u00b7 text compresses 3\u20135\u00d7 \u00b7 checkpoint every 20 diffs.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numbers to say: 1M users \u00b7 10k DAU \u00b7 under 1 RPS (do not shard) \u00b7 1 KB average, 10 MB max \u2248 2.5M tokens (beyond any context window) \u00b7 ~10 prompts per user \u2248 10 GB hot \u00b7 inline body under 64 KB, object storage above \u00b7 text compresses 3\u20135\u00d7 \u00b7 checkpoint every 20 diffs.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ucRVSFWz0PWrFTNKExWq", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 800, "width": 2179.1000000000004, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a0055", "roundness": null, "seed": 896241759, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 328244190, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790609624448, "created": 1790609624448, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Frontend checklist: virtualised editor \u00b7 lazy-load history and outputs \u00b7 IndexedDB cache + prefetch next version \u00b7 autosave drafts \u00b7 client-side size gate + token counter \u00b7 diffs, compression, chunking, dedupe on upload \u00b7 CDN for shared views \u00b7 HTTP/2 (gRPC only service-to-service).", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Frontend checklist: virtualised editor \u00b7 lazy-load history and outputs \u00b7 IndexedDB cache + prefetch next version \u00b7 autosave drafts \u00b7 client-side size gate + token counter \u00b7 diffs, compression, chunking, dedupe on upload \u00b7 CDN for shared views \u00b7 HTTP/2 (gRPC only service-to-service).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "QNsDLK8nwSHTNSgxbUv8", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 855, "width": 52.800000000000004, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "OnMyseKiEItdhpwEboN0", "index": "a